	<meta property="og:description" content="The City of Asheville is committed to transparent, data-driven decision-making to create equitable outcomes for everyone in our community. Regular reporting on progress toward Council-defined priorities is a key component of that commitment.  Asheville operates on a fiscal year (FY) basis that runs from July 1 through June 30, with the fiscal year designated by the [...]" />
