    <main id="content" class="site-content flex-grow-1"><div class="container px-0">
  <div id="primary" class="content-area">
    <div class="site-main">

      <div id="post-82657" class="px-3 px-md-0 post-82657 page type-page status-publish hentry avl_department-city-clerk avl_department-city-managers-office avl_department-communication-public-engagement">
      <header class="entry-header border-bottom mb-3">
      <h2 class="entry-title">Annual Council Priorities</h2>      <div class="entry-meta pb-2">
        
<p class="my-0 py-0">
  <small class="">
    Last updated or reviewed on March 9, 2026  </small>
</p>      </div>
    </header>
  
  <div class="entry-content">
    <p>The City of Asheville is committed to transparent, data-driven decision-making to create equitable outcomes for everyone in our community. Regular reporting on progress toward Council-defined priorities is a key component of that commitment. </p>
<p>Asheville operates on a fiscal year (FY) basis that runs from July 1 through June 30, with the fiscal year designated by the year in which it ends. Thus, FY26 began on July 1, 2025 and will end on June 30, 2026.</p>
<p><a href="/government/council-vision/">View Council Vision 2036 Focus Areas</a></p>
<hr />
<h3>Annual Reports</h3>
<p>The City&#8217;s fiscal year runs from July 1 &#8211; June 30 each year. Annual reports serve to highlight many of the achievements and successes from throughout the year and the work that was done to fulfill the City Council&#8217;s vision and priorities.</p>
<p><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vDho-cSq4z6B0S3t7RgRNBMxW9QPhcNv/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Annual Report FY 2023-2024 English</a><br />
<a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vF52faTcIU2FL0K6Gu7VEYPny9rcbZij/view?usp=drive_link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Annual Report FY 2023-2024 Spanish</a></p>
<hr />


<style>
  /* .text-warning { */
  /* override bootstrap default to boost color contrast for "in progress, delayed" icon */
  /* color: rgba(0, 137, 147, 1) !important; */
  /* } */
</style>



<nav class="bg-white mt-5" aria-label="Fiscal year selection">
  <ul class="nav nav-tabs " id="fyTabs" role="tablist">
          <li class="nav-item fy-tab mb-0" role="presentation">
        <button class="nav-link ml-2  active" id="2026-tab" data-toggle="tab" data-fy="2026" data-target="#fy-2026" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="fy-2026" aria-selected="true">
          FY26        </button>
      </li>
          <li class="nav-item fy-tab mb-0" role="presentation">
        <button class="nav-link ml-2 " id="2025-tab" data-toggle="tab" data-fy="2025" data-target="#fy-2025" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="fy-2025" aria-selected="false">
          FY25        </button>
      </li>
          <li class="nav-item fy-tab mb-0" role="presentation">
        <button class="nav-link ml-2 " id="2024-tab" data-toggle="tab" data-fy="2024" data-target="#fy-2024" type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="fy-2024" aria-selected="false">
          FY24        </button>
      </li>
